tpm2-tss: tpm2-tss (TPM2 software stack)
tpm2-tss:
tpm2-tss: TPM2 software stack, a port of the TCG TSS 2.0 (Trusted Software
tpm2-tss: Stack) specification. It provides SAPI, ESAPI, and FAPI
tpm2-tss: implementations along with utility libraries for communication
tpm2-tss: with TPM2 devices and simulators.
tpm2-tss:
tpm2-tss: This includes:
tpm2-tss:   * System API (SAPI)
tpm2-tss:   * Enhanced System API (ESAPI)
tpm2-tss:   * Feature API (FAPI)
tpm2-tss:   * Marshalling/Unmarshalling (MU)
tpm2-tss:   * TCTI and TCTILDR modules
tpm2-tss:   * TSS2 Policy library
tpm2-tss:
tpm2-tss: Homepage: https://github.com/tpm2-software/tpm2-tss
